WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:10.920
For wedding parents who worry about heavy sweating or menopausal hot flashes, here's how experts keep your look fresh throughout the day.

2
00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:15.528
The most effective tools are a portable handheld fan and cooling patches.

3
00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:22.608
Cooling patches placed on the back of the neck or ankles — key spots for temperature regulation — quickly cool the blood and lower body heat.

4
00:00:22.944 --> 00:00:27.624
Use the handheld fan on your face and hair while moving around, so sweat doesn't have a chance to form,

5
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:34.272
but keep it about 30 cm away to avoid drying your skin or messing up flyaway hairs.

6
00:00:34.608 --> 00:00:42.504
Technically, a special sweat-absorbing powder is pressed carefully into the oily T-zone and V-zone to keep the base from breaking down.

7
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:50.328
Waterproof, tear- and sweat-resistant products along with strong setting sprays are applied in stages to keep your eye makeup clean until the end.

8
00:00:50.664 --> 00:00:59.544
During the ceremony, have a family member nearby with a clean puff or tissue — when sweat beads up, gently press to absorb it rather than rubbing.

9
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.048
Drinking astragalus or kudzu tea regularly starting a month before the wedding can also help reduce excess sweating.

10
00:01:06.384 --> 00:01:15.816
Just mention during your one-on-one consultation that you sweat easily, and we'll prepare products and techniques tailored to you — turning worry into confidence on the day.
